WEBVTT

00:00:00.240 --> 00:00:05.706
God did not design our lives merely to
struggle in this material world, in a

00:00:05.706 --> 00:00:07.360
corruptible human life.

00:00:07.360 --> 00:00:13.179
God has a glorious way of salvation: He sent
His beloved Son, Jesus Christ, to this

00:00:13.179 --> 00:00:13.600
earth.

00:00:13.600 --> 00:00:19.740
The Lord Jesus is God becoming man.
Outwardly He was a man; inwardly He was God.

00:00:19.740 --> 00:00:26.624
His words and actions had power. When sick
people touched Him, power went out from

00:00:26.624 --> 00:00:26.960
Him.

00:00:26.960 --> 00:00:31.835
A woman suffering from a flow of blood,
losing her vitality, secretly touched the

00:00:31.835 --> 00:00:33.340
fringe of Jesus' garment.

00:00:33.340 --> 00:00:35.180
The Lord immediately asked, “Who touched
Me?”

00:00:35.700 --> 00:00:39.040
Those beside Him said, “Everyone is pressing
against You. Why ask who touched You?”

00:00:39.040 --> 00:00:43.400
He said, “No, someone touched Me. Power has
gone out from Me.”

00:00:43.400 --> 00:00:48.760
Pressing against Jesus and touching Him by
faith are different things.

00:00:49.420 --> 00:00:52.220
You can join the crowd and still fail to
touch the Lord.

00:00:52.220 --> 00:00:57.660
But sincerely say, “Lord, I am willing to
try.” Immediately, the connection is made.

00:00:57.660 --> 00:01:03.260
You have used the right organ. It is like
transferring data between computers.

00:01:03.260 --> 00:01:08.930
I have two computers and want to transfer
the data from one to the other. I connect

00:01:08.930 --> 00:01:10.160
them with a cable.

00:01:10.160 --> 00:01:14.000
Press “send” on one and “receive” on the
other, and the data is transferred.

00:01:14.000 --> 00:01:19.880
Even in the material world, electronics can
do such remarkable things.

00:01:19.880 --> 00:01:26.499
This glorious God wants to impart His
divine, glorious life into us. So He made a

00:01:26.499 --> 00:01:27.480
preparation.

00:01:27.480 --> 00:01:34.077
Simply put, He came to earth for us, passed
through human life, and spoke words of

00:01:34.077 --> 00:01:34.560
grace.

00:01:34.560 --> 00:01:37.120
He said, “I am the way, the reality, and the
life.”

00:01:37.120 --> 00:01:39.840
He said, “I have come that they may have
life.”

00:01:39.840 --> 00:01:42.300
He said, “I am the bread of life.”

00:01:42.300 --> 00:01:45.360
Those who eat of Me will not hunger; those
who drink of Me will never thirst.

00:01:45.360 --> 00:01:49.866
Man shall not live on bread alone, but on
every word that proceeds out through the

00:01:49.866 --> 00:01:50.580
mouth of God.

00:01:51.560 --> 00:01:56.874
People thirst, not for lack of water, and
hunger, not for lack of bread, but for

00:01:56.874 --> 00:01:58.800
hearing the words of Jehovah.

00:01:59.980 --> 00:02:03.620
But here is the problem: we have already
been defiled.

00:02:03.620 --> 00:02:06.740
You would not put ginseng tea in a
contaminated vessel.

00:02:06.740 --> 00:02:11.680
A defiled life cannot contain eternal life.
We need to be cleansed.

00:02:11.680 --> 00:02:16.140
So the Lord Jesus was nailed to the cross
for us.

00:02:16.140 --> 00:02:21.380
Two nails pierced His hands, and two nails
pierced His feet.

00:02:21.380 --> 00:02:28.640
A crown of thorns was placed on His head.
They struck His head, causing it to bleed.

00:02:28.640 --> 00:02:33.968
What does this signify? The blood from His
hands washes away the sins committed by our

00:02:33.968 --> 00:02:34.340
hands.

00:02:34.340 --> 00:02:38.860
The blood from His feet cleanses us from
running along unrighteous paths.

00:02:38.860 --> 00:02:43.440
The blood from His head cleanses the unclean
thoughts in our minds.

00:02:43.440 --> 00:02:48.662
Think of our thoughts over the past year,
month, or week. Would we dare make a film of

00:02:48.662 --> 00:02:50.180
them for others to watch?

00:02:50.180 --> 00:02:55.760
We know there is much we would be ashamed
of. Something within us is wrong.

00:02:55.760 --> 00:03:00.220
So the Lord Jesus died for us. At the end,
He spoke these words:

00:03:00.220 --> 00:03:03.680
“Father, forgive them, for they do not know
what they are doing.”

00:03:03.680 --> 00:03:09.040
Before His last breath, He did not say, “It
is over.” He said, “It is finished.”

00:03:09.640 --> 00:03:13.480
He accomplished eternal redemption—the Lamb
for mankind.

00:03:13.480 --> 00:03:16.460
“Behold, the Lamb of God, who takes away the
sin of the world!”

00:03:16.460 --> 00:03:22.520
At that very moment, the veil in the temple
was torn in two from top to bottom.

00:03:22.520 --> 00:03:25.500
Not from bottom to top! Peter did not
secretly cut it with scissors.

00:03:25.500 --> 00:03:31.794
God tore it from top to bottom, signifying
that the barrier between God and man had

00:03:31.794 --> 00:03:32.780
been removed.

00:03:32.780 --> 00:03:40.013
A new and living way was opened, so we can
enter the Holy of Holies, come before God,

00:03:40.013 --> 00:03:42.140
and receive eternal life.

00:03:42.860 --> 00:03:47.143
So the Bible says of this crucified and
resurrected Lord: “The last Adam became a

00:03:47.143 --> 00:03:48.200
life-giving Spirit.”
